  unitName: Volteg
  unitId: 40632
  unitNumber: 1165
  description: A thunder dragon that has swallowed one of the amethysts mined deep
    in the crystal caverns of Ishgria. It devastates the targets of its attacks with
    its robust constitution and razor-sharp talons. It also heals most damage immediately
    as long as the amethyst in its chest is intact. Generally moving in packs, the
    thunder dragon with the largest amethyst in its chest leads the group. Accordingly,
    theories contend that the amethysts also determine rank among them.
  summonDesc: Grrr...<br>The crystal's power...<br>...is mine.
  fusionDesc: '*Snarl* Grr...<br>I will not...<br>...follow your orders.'
  evoDesc: Grr, rarrr...<br>Incomprehensible...<br>What is your goal?
